<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Loan Terms & Conditions - Capital Trust Bank</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />

  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://placehold.co/32x32/2563EB/DBEAFE?text=CTBank" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="https://placehold.co/16x16/2563EB/DBEAFE?text=CTBank" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="https://placehold.co/180x180/2563EB/DBEAFE?text=CTBank" />
  <link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#2563EB" />
</head>

<body class="bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-100 to-gray-100 min-h-screen p-6 space-y-6 relative">

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16 mb-16">
    <button onclick="history.back()" class="inline-block mb-6 px-4 py-2 fixed left-0 right-0 top-0 bg-blue-600 text-white  hover:bg-blue-700 transition">
      &larr; Back
    </button>

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-blue-700 mb-6">Loan Terms &amp; Conditions – Capital Trust Bank</h1>

    <p class="mb-2 font-semibold">Effective Date: <span class="font-normal">present</span></p>
    <p class="mb-6 font-semibold">Last Updated: <span class="font-normal">01-01-2025</span></p>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">1️⃣ Eligibility for Loan</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>You must be at least 18 years old to apply for a loan.</li>
        <li>You must be a registered user on our platform with valid identification.</li>
        <li>A guarantor’s name and contact information must be provided for every loan application.</li>
        <li>Approval of your loan is subject to verification of your details and our credit assessment.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">2️⃣ Loan Amount &amp; Interest Rates</h2>
      <p class="mb-3 text-gray-700">Loan amounts will vary based on your account history and eligibility.</p>
      <p class="mb-3 text-gray-700">Interest rates are fixed based on your chosen loan term:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-gray-700">
        <li>✅ 7 – 10 days: 5% interest</li>
        <li>✅ 1 month: 20% interest</li>
        <li>✅ 3 months: 25% interest</li>
        <li>✅ 6 months: 30% interest</li>
        <li>✅ 1 year: 40% interest</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">3️⃣ Repayment Terms</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>All loans must be repaid on or before the due date to avoid penalties.</li>
        <li>You may repay early without penalty, but interest will still apply based on the original term selected.</li>
        <li>Failure to repay on time will trigger late fees and may impact your credit score within the platform.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">4️⃣ Guarantor Responsibility</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>By providing a guarantor, you confirm they are aware of their responsibility in the event of default.</li>
        <li>The guarantor may be contacted to facilitate repayment if the borrower defaults.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">5️⃣ Late Payments &amp; Penalties</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>A late fee of 5% of the loan amount may be charged for overdue payments.</li>
        <li>Repeated defaults may lead to account suspension and reporting to relevant financial authorities.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">6️⃣ Loan Approval &amp; Rejection</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>Loan approval is not automatic and may require manual verification.</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to reject any loan application without providing detailed reasons.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">7️⃣ Data Privacy</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>Your personal and guarantor details are kept confidential and are only shared as required for loan processing.</li>
        <li>We comply with all applicable data protection regulations.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">8️⃣ Modification of Terms</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>We may update these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time.</li>
        <li>Continued use of the loan services after updates implies acceptance of the changes.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">📩 Contact Us</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-1">For any questions about these terms or loan services, reach out via:</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-1">📧 support@ctbank.com</p>
      <p class="text-gray-700">📞 [Insert Support Phone Number]</p>
    </section>
  </div>

</body>

</html>
